{"user": "nah like it doesn't flip colors in a diagonal line", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T18:33:45.857768+00:00", "assistant": "It *does* flip diagonally \u2014 but only if the diagonal is **unbroken white discs ending in a black disc**.\n\nExample here: if Black plays **g2**, the diagonal down-left goes **f3\u2013e4\u2013d5** white, ending at **c6** black, so those would flip.\n\nIf there\u2019s an empty square or no black disc at the far end, then that diagonal won\u2019t flip.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T18:33:50.113485+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T18:33:51.634951+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud"], "llama": ["Think Aloud"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 1, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 0.3333333333333333, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Local Justification", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arb