{"user": "if i go b7, then after that white could get a corner", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T18:34:52.575700+00:00", "assistant": "Yes \u2014 good catch. After **b7**, White can take the **a8 corner** via the diagonal **a8\u2013b7\u2013c6\u2013d5**.\n\nBut ask: if White spends a move on **a8**, what strong reply does Black get next? In endgames, a corner can be worth allowing if it leaves White with poor mobility or lets Black win the final count.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T18:35:19.785968+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T18:35:21.054280+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Positive Feedback": 3}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Positive Feedback": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"], "votes": {"Worked Line": 2, "General Principle": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Positive Feedback": 3, "Local Justification": 2}, "confidence": {"Worked Line": 0.666