{"user": "Not sure they'd be in a better position", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T18:36:05.121815+00:00", "assistant": "Right \u2014 giving White **a8** looks scary.\n\nBut check the follow-up: after **b7 \u2192 White a8**, Black may be able to play near that corner safely because the corner is already gone. Ask yourself:\n\n- Does White\u2019s **a8** flip enough to matter?\n- What Black reply restores control on the left/bottom area?\n- Does White get many moves afterward, or are they cramped?\n\nSo the corner alone doesn\u2019t decide it \u2014 the **next move and final count** do.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T18:36:22.362891+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T18:36:24.908732+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Metacomment": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Metacomment": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Metacomment"], "llama": ["Think Aloud"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Neutral Feedback": 1, "Hint": 1, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Neutral Feedback": 0.3333333333333333, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Local Justification", "Worked Li